# Run with the English ROM by path (the Japanese one has the same code A3UJ, and its kana name entry stops this script):
#   3ds/test/dualrun.py "<rom dir>/Mother 3 (Eng v1.2).gba" 3ds/test/play/mother-3.play OUT
